+test('EV-152 I1：--cancel 结束 worker 以 killTree 拉起的两侧审查员 CLI（整组），归档仍由 cancelRun 收尾为 cancelled', { skip: bundleMissing && bundleSkipReason }, async () => {
+  const r = await cancelReachesCli({ gemini: { mode: 'hang_cli' }, glm: { mode: 'hang_cli' } });
